972f554046e6794378effc81c06942e4e3bf1a03
SMP: Add clh_lock_acquire_slowpath

To keep the rare congested case out of the fast path.

Set node->myreq->state to CLHState_Pending at unlock time, when it
is still cache hot and makes more sense. This does require it to be
initially set to pending, so update clh_lock_init() too.

Update ftp link to a http one for the paper this lock is based on.

